{"sha": "aebd28f7560d1610cc132f436adb142cc928c134ff4daac88c8b4708a0cca7a9", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "显式形式可由直接归纳得出。对于等差数列的和，", "记 $S = u_0 + \\dots + u_n$，将同一和式按相反次序写出并与之相加：", "上下对应的 $n+1$ 个列和都等于 $u_0 + u_n$，故 $2S = (n+1)(u_0+u_n)$。", "对于等比数列的和，计算 $S - qS$：除首项与末项外，", "其余各项两两相消，故 $(1-q)S = u_0(1 - q^{n+1})$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{数列的极限}", "", "\\begin{definition}[收敛数列]\\label{def:g12:seq:limit}", "称数列 $(u_n)$ \\emph{收敛}\\index{极限!数列}于实数", "$\\ell$，若包含 $\\ell$ 的每个开区间都从某项起包含全部项", "$u_n$。记作 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to+\\infty} u_n = \\ell$。", "", "等价地：对任意 $\\varepsilon > 0$，存在 $N \\in \\N$，使得", "对所有 $n \\geq N$，有 $\\abs{u_n - \\ell} \\leq \\varepsilon$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=11cm, height=5.6cm,", "  xlabel={$n$}, ylabel={$u_n$},", "  xmin=0, xmax=16.5, ymin=0.7, ymax=2.9,", "  xtick={4}, xticklabels={$N$}, ytick={2}, yticklabels={$\\ell$}]", "  \\fill[omDef!20] (axis cs:0,1.75) rectangle (axis cs:16.5,2.25);", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, domain=0:16.5] {2};", "  \\addplot[omDef, only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.5pt,", "    samples at={1,...,16}] {2 + (-1)^x/x};", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:4,0.7) -- (axis cs:4,2.25);", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=east] at (axis cs:16.3,2.4) {$\\ell+\\varepsilon$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=east] at (axis cs:16.3,1.6) {$\\ell-\\varepsilon$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 数列 $u_n = 2 + \\frac{(-1)^n}{n}$ 收敛于 $\\ell = 2$：给定", "$\\varepsilon > 0$，从第 $N$ 项起，所有项都落在", "带形区域 $\\intcc{\\ell-\\varepsilon}{\\ell+\\varepsilon}$ 内。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[发散到无穷]\\label{def:g12:seq:infinity}", "称数列 $(u_n)$ \\emph{趋于 $+\\infty$}，若对任意 $A \\in \\R$，", "存在 $N \\in \\N$，使得 $u_n \\geq A$ 对一切 $n \\geq N$ 成立。记作", "$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to+\\infty} u_n = +\\infty$；", "$\\lim u_n = -\\infty$ 的定义类似。不收敛的数列", "称为\\emph{发散}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "数列可以发散而不趋于 $\\pm\\infty$：数列", "$u_n = (-1)^n$ 只取值 $1$ 与 $-1$，没有极限。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[极限的唯一性]\\label{prop:g12:seq:uniqueness}", "若数列 $(u_n)$ 收敛，则其极限唯一。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "假设 $u_n \\to \\ell$ 且 $u_n \\to \\ell'$，其中 $\\ell \\neq \\ell'$，不妨设", "$\\ell < \\ell'$。取 $\\varepsilon = \\frac{\\ell' - \\ell}{3} > 0$。从某项起，", "有 $\\abs{u_n - \\ell} \\leq \\varepsilon$ 且", "$\\abs{u_n - \\ell'} \\leq \\varepsilon$，因此", "\\[", "\\ell' - \\ell \\leq \\abs{\\ell' - u_n} + \\abs{u_n - \\ell}", "\\leq 2\\varepsilon = \\tfrac{2}{3}(\\ell' - \\ell) < \\ell' - \\ell,", "\\]", "这与假设矛盾。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[极限的运算]\\label{prop:g12:seq:operations}", "设 $(u_n)$ 与 $(v_n)$ 为数列，其极限分别为 $\\ell$ 与 $\\ell'$（有限或", "无穷）。则当右端不是未定式时，", "\\[", "\\lim (u_n + v_n) = \\ell + \\ell', \\qquad", "\\lim (u_n v_n) = \\ell\\,\\ell', \\qquad", "\\lim \\frac{u_n}{v_n} = \\frac{\\ell}{\\ell'}.", "\\]", "未定式为", "$(+\\infty) + (-\\infty)$、$0 \\times \\infty$、$\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}$ 及", "$\\frac{0}{0}$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "我们证明有限极限情形的和法则；其余情形类似，留作", "练习。任取 $\\varepsilon > 0$，存在 $N_1, N_2$，使得", "$\\abs{u_n - \\ell} \\leq \\varepsilon/2$ 对 $n \\geq N_1$ 成立，且", "$\\abs{v_n - \\ell'} \\leq \\varepsilon/2$ 对 $n \\geq N_2$ 成立。对", "$n \\geq \\max(N_1, N_2)$，由三角不等式得", "\\[", "\\abs{(u_n + v_n) - (\\ell + \\ell')}", "\\leq \\abs{u_n - \\ell} + \\abs{v_n - \\ell'} \\leq \\varepsilon. \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[提取主导项处理未定式]\\label{met:g12:seq:indeterminate}", "遇到未定式时，提出主导项。例如", "\\[", "n^2 - n = n^2\\left(1 - \\tfrac{1}{n}\\right) \\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} +\\infty,", "\\qquad", "\\frac{2n^2+1}{n^2 - n} = \\frac{2 + 1/n^2}{1 - 1/n}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{} 2 .", "\\]", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{收敛定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[比较定理与夹逼定理]\\label{thm:g12:seq:squeeze}", "设 $(u_n)$、$(v_n)$、$(w_n)$ 为数列。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若从某项起 $u_n \\leq v_n$，且 $u_n \\to +\\infty$，则", "        $v_n \\to +\\infty$。", "  \\item （\\emph{夹逼定理}\\index{夹逼定理}）若", "        从某项起 $u_n \\leq v_n \\leq w_n$，且 $(u_n)$ 与 $(w_n)$", "        都收敛于同一极限 $\\ell$，则 $(v_n)$ 收敛", "        于 $\\ell$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}